From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Smita Koralahalli <Smita.KoralahalliChannabasappa@amd.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Feb 2026 06:45:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] NVIDIA: VR: SAUCE: dax/hmem: Reintroduce Soft Reserved ranges
 back into the iomem tree

BugLink: https://bugs.launchpad.net/bugs/2153819

Reworked from a patch by Alison Schofield <alison.schofield@intel.com>

Reintroduce Soft Reserved range into the iomem_resource tree for HMEM
to consume.

This restores visibility in /proc/iomem for ranges actively in use, while
avoiding the early-boot conflicts that occurred when Soft Reserved was
published into iomem before CXL window and region discovery.

